<title>USA: Quest Medical adopts new rights plan.</title>
<headline>Quest Medical adopts new rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quest Medical Inc said Friday directors voted to redeem the outstanding rights issued under the shareholders' rights plan adopted in 1989 and adopted a new rights plan.</p>
<p>The company said the old rights are being redeemed at the pre-established redemption price of $0.01 per right.</p>
<p>It said the rights under the new plan will be distributed as a dividend to owners of record on September 12.</p>
<p>Quest said the new plan was not adopted in response to any known offers for  the company.</p>
</text>
